# Real contact records and real prospect metadata never belong in this public repo.
# The scanner and the prospect discovery layer both read local stores; neither is committed.
*.local.json
*.local.md

# Materialized candidate workspaces. Exploration downloads real repositories' localization
# files so the scanner can read them offline; those files are somebody else's, they are
# large, and they are not this repository's to carry.
*.local/
workspace.local/
